{"text": "The spin state is \\(|\\psi\\rangle = 0.5|\\uparrow\\rangle + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}|\\downarrow\\rangle\\).  \nThe expectation values are:\n\\[\\langle\\sigma_z\\rangle = (0.5)^2(1) + \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)^2(-1) = 0.25 - 0.75 = -0.5\\]\n\\[\\langle\\sigma_x\\rangle = 2 \\times 0.5 \\times \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\times 1 = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\approx 0.866\\]\nFor the operator \\(10\\sigma_z + 5\\sigma_x\\):\n\\[\\langle 10\\sigma_z + 5\\sigma_x \\rangle = 10(-0.5) + 5\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right) = -5 + \\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\approx -0.6699\\]\nRounded to one decimal place, this is \\(-0.7\\).\n\nAnswer: A", "reasoning": "We are given a spin-1/2 particle in a linear superposition state:\n\n|ψ> = 0.5 |↑> + (√3 / 2) |↓>\n\nHere |↑> and |↓> are eigenstates of σ_z. The operator is:\n\nA = 10 σ_z + 5 σ_x\n\nWe need the expectation value <A> = <ψ|A|ψ>, up to one decimal place.\n\nLet's find the expectation value.\n\nσ_z and σ_x are Pauli matrices.\n\nEigenstates of σ_z:\n\nσ_z |↑> = +1 |↑>\nσ_z |↓> = -1 |↓>\n\nσ_x acts as:\nσ_x |↑> = |↓>\nσ_x |↓> = |↑>\n\nLet's compute <ψ|A|ψ>:\n\n<ψ| = 0.5 <↑| + (√3/2) <↓|\n\n|ψ> = 0.5 |↑> + (√3/2) |↓>\n\nFirst, compute σ_z|ψ>:\n\nσ_z(0.5|↑> + (√3/2)|↓>) = 0.5(+1)|↑> + (√3/2)(-1)|↓> = 0.5|↑> - (√3/2)|↓>\n\nThen <ψ|σ_z|ψ> = (0.5 <↑| + (√3/2) <↓|) * (0.5|↑> - (√3/2)|↓>) \n= 0.5*0.5 <↑|↑> + 0.5*(-√3/2) <↑|↓> + (√3/2)*0.5 <↓|↑> + (√3/2)*(-√3/2) <↓|↓>\n= (0.25)*1 + 0 + 0 + (-3/4)*1 = 0.25 - 0.75 = -0.5.\n\nNow σ_x|ψ>:\n\nσ_x(0.5|↑> + (√3/2)|↓>) = 0.5|↓> + (√3/2)|↑> = (√3/2)|↑> + 0.5|↓>\n\nThen <ψ|σ_x|ψ> = (0.5 <↑| + (√3/2) <↓|) * ((√3/2)|↑> + 0.5|↓>)\n= 0.5*(√3/2) <↑|↑> + 0.5*0.5 <↑|↓> + (√3/2)*(√3/2) <↓|↑> + (√3/2)*0.5 <↓|↓>\n= (√3/4)*1 + 0 + 0 + (√3/4)*1 = √3/2 ≈ 0.866.\n\n(Alternatively, one can find density matrix or directly compute expectation.)\n\nWe want <10 σ_z + 5 σ_x> = 10 <σ_z> + 5 <σ_x> = 10*(-0.5) + 5*(√3/2) = -5 + (5√3)/2 = -5 + 5*0.866025... = -5 + 4.3301... = -0.6699...\n\nUp to one decimal place: -0.7.\n\nSo the answer is (A).\n\nLet's double-check: -5 + (5*1.73205)/2 = -5 + 8.66025/2 = -5 + 4.3301 = -0.6699 ≈ -0.7.\n\nThus option (A) is correct.", "prompt_tokens": 151, "completion_tokens": 1017, "reasoning_tokens": 793, "total_tokens": 1168, "cached": false, "latency_s": 10.891, "model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "finish_reason": "stop", "raw_key": "9dcffe0916d40cc5fa438bd4f446c2a0062eb8e031c687e941ba5cba12735df0"}